"answer": "Project Zenith is a cloud storage optimization initiative launched in Q3 2023, led by Marcus Cole, with a focus on security and accessibility. The project has expanded its team with experts in machine learning and cloud computing and is exploring AI partnerships with TechInnovate. Key milestones include the successful testing of a secure file sharing prototype ahead of schedule, with the next phase involving UI enhancements starting in October. The project has also achieved a breakthrough in predictive analytics, which will be detailed in a November 20th staff meeting. Additionally, the project has secured increased budgets for compliance ($55,000) and training ($15,000) to support development, audits, and specialized team training."
